Cell["SuperCrown codimension-two boundary HR", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"92e5d3a4-90ca-4a1f-bf9e-ad4d23230a6a"],

Cell["\<\
This focused constructive check restores the SuperCrown example without \
attempting a full boundary survey. On B={x8=0,x9=0}, the restricted \
polynomial contains the Crown superleading polynomial multiplied by x10 x11. \
The present polynomial-factor path finds the two Crown generators, zero \
obstruction and one exact region vector. Boundary equations x_e=0 and scaling \
components v_e are reported separately.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"2c76b981-1296-4464-8c01-9cb4ff1e4fc6"],

